stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Missing: key not in Redis
    Missing --> Processing: claim.lua SET processing + fence_token

    Processing --> Completed: complete.lua (matching fence)
    Processing --> Failed: fail.lua (matching fence)
    Processing --> InProgress409: concurrent claim, lock_until valid
    Processing --> Expired: lock_until elapsed

    Expired --> Processing: reclaim with NEW fence_token

    Completed --> Completed: replay claim.lua code 2
    Failed --> Failed: replay claim.lua code 2

    note right of Processing
        Stale worker with old fence_token
        cannot complete or fail after reclaim
    end note
